    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300a\u70b9\u5230\u4e3a\u6b62\u300b is a light 2D shooting game centered around clicks! The game lasts about 2 hours and includes over 15 levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will play as an elite team of 5 firepower fighters in the game - Tian WeiMing, by clicking to eliminate enemies and bullets, protecting partners to complete the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core gameplay - easy to pick up points!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434240/extras/7715b1992c5ef2850db8ab97e39ac953.poster.avif?t=1741350349\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434240/extras/7715b1992c5ef2850db8ab97e39ac953.webm?t=1741350349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434240/extras/7715b1992c5ef2850db8ab97e39ac953.mp4?t=1741350349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminate enemies and bullets by moving the mouse and clicking! Protect your allies from harm in the enemy's wave of attacks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(No matter what you encounter, just click it!)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Youth story: In addition to battles, it also includes a small amount of text stories and simple animations; You will be able to witness a youth drama on the battlefield: stories about the team members! This will also be your first step in uncovering the mystery of the world of superpowers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Partner Assistance: Unleash powerful partner skills in battle! Even if you are not good at action games, you can still experience the fun of intense battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434240/extras/1613ad458e5953c2436ae26e9b86a86c.poster.avif?t=1741350349\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434240/extras/1613ad458e5953c2436ae26e9b86a86c.webm?t=1741350349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434240/extras/1613ad458e5953c2436ae26e9b86a86c.mp4?t=1741350349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you want to know the latest development progress of \u300a\u70b9\u5230\u4e3a\u6b62\u300b? Please follow Bilibili account: Kuaiyou Games;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the official QQ group: 1015092142, and give direct feedback on your ideas to the producer!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300a\u70b9\u5230\u4e3a\u6b62\u300b is a light 2D shooting game centered around clicks! The game lasts about 2 hours and includes over 15 levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will play as an elite team of 5 firepower fighters in the game - Tian WeiMing, by clicking to eliminate enemies and bullets, protecting partners to complete the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core gameplay - easy to pick up points!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434240/extras/7715b1992c5ef2850db8ab97e39ac953.poster.avif?t=1741350349\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434240/extras/7715b1992c5ef2850db8ab97e39ac953.webm?t=1741350349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434240/extras/7715b1992c5ef2850db8ab97e39ac953.mp4?t=1741350349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminate enemies and bullets by moving the mouse and clicking! Protect your allies from harm in the enemy's wave of attacks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(No matter what you encounter, just click it!)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Youth story: In addition to battles, it also includes a small amount of text stories and simple animations; You will be able to witness a youth drama on the battlefield: stories about the team members! This will also be your first step in uncovering the mystery of the world of superpowers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Partner Assistance: Unleash powerful partner skills in battle! Even if you are not good at action games, you can still experience the fun of intense battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434240/extras/1613ad458e5953c2436ae26e9b86a86c.poster.avif?t=1741350349\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434240/extras/1613ad458e5953c2436ae26e9b86a86c.webm?t=1741350349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434240/extras/1613ad458e5953c2436ae26e9b86a86c.mp4?t=1741350349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you want to know the latest development progress of \u300a\u70b9\u5230\u4e3a\u6b62\u300b? Please follow Bilibili account: Kuaiyou Games;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the official QQ group: 1015092142, and give direct feedback on your ideas to the producer!</p>",
